# Derived artifacts never belong in history — a derived file in the
# repository is a file that can be stale (issue 306).
src/generated/
# The RAM tiers are machine-local by definition.
tmp
# Editor droppings.
*.swp
*~
# Tools this project fetched for itself. Downloaded and derived, so the
# same rule as everything else here applies (issue 306) — and a local
# toolchain in history would also be a several-hundred-megabyte answer
# to a question nobody asked when cloning.
toolchain/
# The HTML mirror of the documentation. Generated from the markdown by
# `make html` on every build, so a copy in history is a copy that can
# disagree with the documents it was made from (issue 306, again).
docs/HTML/
